# Figma API Configuration
# =======================
# Get your Personal Access Token from: https://www.figma.com/developers/api#access-tokens
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Go to Figma Settings > Account > Personal Access Tokens
# 2. Generate a new token with read access
# 3. Copy the token and paste it below
FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_token_here

# Extract the FILE_KEY from your Figma URL
# Example: https://www.figma.com/design/{FILE_KEY}/Catalist-UI
# Copy everything between /design/ and the next /
FIGMA_FILE_KEY=your_file_key_here
